<title>USA: TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, California 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $450,000 Acura Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Naoko Sawamatsu</p>
<p>(Japan) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat 7-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>8-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Magui Serna (Spain) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 7-5</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Tatiana Panova (Russia) 6-1 6-0.</p>
<p>Venus Williams (U.S.) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
